{"id":"n1-065","title":"Noun に先駆けて (〜ni saki gakete)","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Meaning 'ahead of', 'before', or 'preceding in time'.","longExplanation":"The grammar point 〜に先駆けて indicates something happening ahead or before something else in terms of time. Typically used in written language or formal speech.","formation":"Noun + に先駆けて","examples":[{"jp":"この映画は日本に先駆けて、アメリカで公開されました。","romaji":"Kono eiga wa Nippon ni sakigakete, Amerika de koukai saremashita.","en":"This film was released in America ahead of Japan.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"映画","vocabId":"1173720","reading":"えいが"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"日本","vocabId":"1582710","reading":"にほん"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"先駆け","vocabId":"1593680","reading":"さきがけ","baseForm":"先駆ける"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"アメリカ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"公開","vocabId":"1273370","reading":"こうかい"},{"surface":"さ","vocabId":"1291070","reading":"さ","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"れ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"れる"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4,5,6]},{"jp":"彼は周りの人々に先駆けて、その発表を聞いた。","romaji":"Kare wa mawari no hitobito ni sakigakete, sono happyou o kiita.","en":"He heard the announcement before the people around him.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"周り","vocabId":"1604290","reading":"まわり"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"人々","vocabId":"1580650","reading":"ひとびと"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"先駆け","vocabId":"1593680","reading":"さきがけ","baseForm":"先駆ける"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"その","vocabId":null},{"surface":"発表","vocabId":"1477840","reading":"はっぴょう"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"聞い","vocabId":"1591110","reading":"きく","baseForm":"聞く"},{"sur